d SDK Build-Tools 34 | build-tools/34.0.0/  \n  build-tools;35.0.0   | 35.0.0  | Android SDK Build-Tools 35 | build-tools/35.0.0/  \n  patcher;v4           | 1       | SDK Patch Applier v4       | patcher/v4/          \n  platform-tools       | 35.0.2  | Android SDK Platform-Tools | platform-tools/      \n  platforms;android-34 | 3       | Android SDK Platform 34    | platforms/android-34/\n  platforms;android-35 | 2       | Android SDK Platform 35    | platforms/android-35/\n\nPlease review this next screen, I'm NOT using _Use Gradle Build_ , the final APK is about 101Mb (with no DEBUG option)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3081a7c8-0283-4c8a-bfbf-8656671fd0cf)\n\nI don't know why checking _Use Gradle Build_ (from Godot Editor) increasing the size of the APK to 319Mb (with no DEBUG option)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14ce9772-b897-4215-8e9b-723dbbf1acf7)\n\nAnd to produce the AAB file with the next options is OK 101Mb with no DEBUG option ready for production\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ec97ddc-1219-40ae-acf3-642f52d437bb)\n\nSo 319Mb vs 101Mb is Ok for the APK file?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2725979149/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2725982125","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104137#issuecomment-2725982125","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104137","id":2725982125,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iey-t","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","follo