/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gerardogc2378/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gerardogc2378/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gerardogc2378/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gerardogc2378/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gerardogc2378/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-14T23:56:54Z","updated_at":"2025-03-14T23:56:54Z","body":"Got it, I didn't know about that hidden option.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c97ff902-81f0-491f-b6c6-db68431a4bc7)\n\nWhat's the difference if you are using or not that hidden option for AAB files?\n\nAAB files are the same size with or without that checked option.\n\nNow for APKs are the same file size using _Advanced Options_ and using the _Compress Native Libraries_.\n\nI got 101 Mb for the new APK with _Advanced Options_ and using the _Compress Native Libraries_\nAnd I got 101 Mb NOT using _Use Gradle Build_\n\nThanks for the explanation","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726027243/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726055123","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104137#issuecomment-2726055123","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104137","id":2726055123,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ifEzT","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T00:26:02Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T00:32:39Z","body":"> What's the difference if you are using or not that hidden option for AAB files?\n> \n> AAB files are the same size with or without that checked option.\n\nFor AAB files it doesn't seem to have any effect, the compression is forced I think. Some details can be found here.\nhttps://developer.android.com/guide/app-bundle/app-bundle-format\n\n The AAB file is intended only for the Play Store. Play Store creates appropriately optimized APKs for users.\n\n`compress_native_libraries` was introduced here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/78780#issuecomment-1943878883\n_The disadvantages of compression are also mentioned there._","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726055123/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]